<p><strong>Summoned via PM:</strong></p>
<p>Hi there gravyismad. So I'm close to a greenlight for this, mainly because you've chosen to base your Tale on an existing SCP and the way you've outlined your story clearly shows you've given it some thought.</p>
<p>My only concern right now is the ending. Could you elaborate a bit more on how you want the story to end? At the moment, it sounds bleak: he comes to the realisation that there's no hope? And then what? Ideally, there should be some kind of bittersweetness to an ending: he gains something, but at the cost of something else.</p>
<p>If you decide to revise the concept / respond below, do drop me another PM and I’ll take another look. For now, all the best!</p>

